{"id":"forecast-06","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-06/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":354.32,"segments":[{"start":2.24,"end":9.18,"text":"You will hear a coordinator talking to volunteer helpers before a race involving a large number","words":[["You",2.24,2.92],["will",2.92,3.12],["hear",3.12,3.34],["a",3.34,3.58],["coordinator",3.58,4.1],["talking",4.1,5.06],["to",5.06,5.34],["volunteer",5.34,5.8],["helpers",5.8,6.42],["before",6.42,7.02],["a",7.02,7.36],["race",7.36,7.74],["involving",7.74,8.14],["a",8.14,8.56],["large",8.56,8.86],["number",8.86,9.18]]},{"start":9.18,"end":48.76,"text":"of people. First you have some time to look at questions 11-14 on page 3. Now listen carefully","words":[["of",9.18,9.4],["people.",9.4,9.72],["First",10.88,11.52],["you",11.52,12.12],["have",12.12,12.32],["some",12.32,12.52],["time",12.52,12.9],["to",12.9,13.16],["look",13.16,13.28],["at",13.28,13.42],["questions",13.42,13.82],["11",13.82,14.58],["-14",14.58,15.48],["on",15.48,16.28],["page",16.28,16.52],["3.",16.52,17.04],["Now",47.58,47.92],["listen",47.92,48.28],["carefully",48.28,48.76]]},{"start":48.76,"end":51.94,"text":"and answer questions 11-14.","words":[["and",48.76,49.4],["answer",49.4,49.68],["questions",49.68,50.16],["11",50.16,50.98],["-14.",50.98,51.94]]},{"start":55.55,"end":61.17,"text":"Thank you for all volunteering to help us with the Bridge to Brisbane farm run. The purpose","words":[["Thank",55.55,56.23],["you",56.23,56.43],["for",56.43,56.71],["all",56.71,57.05],["volunteering",57.05,57.59],["to",57.59,57.85],["help",57.85,58.05],["us",58.05,58.29],["with",58.29,58.59],["the",58.59,58.79],["Bridge",58.79,59.05],["to",59.05,59.25],["Brisbane",59.25,59.53],["farm",59.53,59.87],["run.",59.87,60.05],["The",60.51,60.91],["purpose",60.91,61.17]]},{"start":61.17,"end":66.55,"text":"of this meeting is to give you some information about your duties on race day. Some of you","words":[["of",61.17,61.39],["this",61.39,61.59],["meeting",61.59,61.91],["is",61.91,62.33],["to",62.33,62.49],["give",62.49,62.67],["you",62.67,62.81],["some",62.81,63.05],["information",63.05,63.69],["about",63.69,64.11],["your",64.11,64.33],["duties",64.33,64.71],["on",64.71,65.13],["race",65.13,65.37],["day.",65.37,65.59],["Some",66.15,66.33],["of",66.33,66.43],["you",66.43,66.55]]},{"start":66.55,"end":71.11,"text":"are asking about where you can park on the day. Unfortunately some of the usual places,","words":[["are",66.55,66.69],["asking",66.69,66.93],["about",66.93,67.19],["where",67.19,67.43],["you",67.43,67.53],["can",67.53,67.65],["park",67.65,67.95],["on",67.95,68.19],["the",68.19,68.29],["day.",68.29,68.53],["Unfortunately",69.03,69.55],["some",69.55,70.11],["of",70.11,70.25],["the",70.25,70.37],["usual",70.37,70.69],["places,",70.69,71.11]]},{"start":71.59,"end":75.79,"text":"down by the river for example, will be out of bounds because we will need extra space","words":[["down",71.59,71.77],["by",71.77,72.03],["the",72.03,72.21],["river",72.21,72.41],["for",72.41,72.67],["example,",72.67,73.05],["will",73.61,73.75],["be",73.75,73.87],["out",73.87,74.01],["of",74.01,74.09],["bounds",74.09,74.41],["because",74.41,74.75],["we",74.75,75.01],["will",75.01,75.09],["need",75.09,75.25],["extra",75.25,75.47],["space",75.47,75.79]]},{"start":75.79,"end":81.67,"text":"for emergency vehicles. Probably the best option is the Jack Grey Sportsfield in Barker Street.","words":[["for",75.79,76.01],["emergency",76.01,76.41],["vehicles.",76.41,76.95],["Probably",77.73,78.11],["the",78.11,78.41],["best",78.41,78.73],["option",78.73,79.07],["is",79.07,79.37],["the",79.37,79.59],["Jack",79.59,79.87],["Grey",79.87,80.23],["Sportsfield",80.23,80.91],["in",80.91,81.09],["Barker",81.09,81.53],["Street.",81.53,81.67]]},{"start":82.47,"end":86.81,"text":"Although the closest parking lot is the Metro shopping complex, I would advise you","words":[["Although",82.47,82.87],["the",82.87,83.15],["closest",83.15,83.45],["parking",83.45,83.85],["lot",83.85,84.11],["is",84.11,84.43],["the",84.43,84.61],["Metro",84.61,84.85],["shopping",84.85,85.19],["complex,",85.19,85.61],["I",86.03,86.15],["would",86.15,86.27],["advise",86.27,86.55],["you",86.55,86.81]]},{"start":86.81,"end":90.17,"text":"not to park there as they tend to tow away people who aren't customers.","words":[["not",86.81,87.05],["to",87.05,87.29],["park",87.29,87.53],["there",87.53,87.83],["as",87.83,88.11],["they",88.11,88.29],["tend",88.29,88.53],["to",88.53,88.65],["tow",88.65,88.83],["away",88.83,89.03],["people",89.03,89.35],["who",89.35,89.53],["aren't",89.53,89.73],["customers.",89.73,90.17]]},{"start":91.17,"end":99.93,"text":"At the start line, most of you will be checking that runners have the necessary gear, especially their electronic timing chip, the race number and the identity wristband.","words":[["At",91.17,91.67],["the",91.67,91.77],["start",91.77,91.99],["line,",91.99,92.27],["most",92.45,92.67],["of",92.67,92.81],["you",92.81,92.97],["will",92.97,93.15],["be",93.15,93.27],["checking",93.27,93.53],["that",93.53,93.77],["runners",93.77,93.97],["have",93.97,94.23],["the",94.23,94.37],["necessary",94.37,94.75],["gear,",94.75,95.09],["especially",95.33,95.71],["their",95.71,96.03],["electronic",96.03,96.47],["timing",96.47,96.85],["chip,",96.85,97.15],["the",97.69,97.77],["race",97.77,98.07],["number",98.07,98.31],["and",98.31,98.75],["the",98.75,98.95],["identity",98.95,99.41],["wristband.",99.41,99.93]]},{"start":100.65,"end":105.35,"text":"Make sure that the number is attached to the front of the running shirt or singlet, not the back.","words":[["Make",100.65,101.07],["sure",101.07,101.39],["that",101.39,101.61],["the",101.61,101.73],["number",101.73,102.01],["is",102.01,102.19],["attached",102.19,102.43],["to",102.43,102.67],["the",102.67,102.75],["front",102.75,103.03],["of",103.03,103.21],["the",103.21,103.31],["running",103.31,103.47],["shirt",103.47,103.79],["or",103.79,104.05],["singlet,",104.05,104.41],["not",104.59,104.83],["the",104.83,105.15],["back.",105.15,105.35]]},{"start":105.81,"end":113.31,"text":"The timing chip, which records the runner's time, needs to be clipped onto one of their shoes and check that they are wearing their wristband.","words":[["The",105.81,105.93],["timing",105.93,106.21],["chip,",106.21,106.53],["which",106.75,107.01],["records",107.01,107.49],["the",107.49,107.75],["runner's",107.75,108.05],["time,",108.05,108.39],["needs",108.85,109.29],["to",109.29,109.51],["be",109.51,109.63],["clipped",109.63,109.89],["onto",109.89,110.17],["one",110.17,110.39],["of",110.39,110.49],["their",110.49,110.63],["shoes",110.63,111.03],["and",111.03,111.61],["check",111.61,111.87],["that",111.87,112.03],["they",112.03,112.17],["are",112.17,112.29],["wearing",112.29,112.51],["their",112.51,112.79],["wristband.",112.79,113.31]]},{"start":114.55,"end":119.25,"text":"Some of you will be responsible for organising the starting groups. It's very important","words":[["Some",114.55,115.07],["of",115.07,115.23],["you",115.23,115.39],["will",115.39,115.57],["be",115.57,115.67],["responsible",115.67,116.09],["for",116.09,116.39],["organising",116.39,116.93],["the",116.93,117.13],["starting",117.13,117.45],["groups.",117.45,117.79],["It's",117.99,118.25],["very",118.25,118.67],["important",118.67,119.25]]},{"start":119.25,"end":124.95,"text":"that runners start in a particular order. There is a system of colour codes. The red group","words":[["that",119.25,119.51],["runners",119.51,119.71],["start",119.71,120.13],["in",120.13,120.39],["a",120.39,120.51],["particular",120.51,120.83],["order.",120.83,121.41],["There",122.17,122.39],["is",122.39,122.51],["a",122.51,122.65],["system",122.65,122.91],["of",122.91,123.17],["colour",123.17,123.41],["codes.",123.41,123.73],["The",124.41,124.45],["red",124.45,124.67],["group",124.67,124.95]]},{"start":124.95,"end":129.61,"text":"are walkers and people with baby strollers. The purple group are runners that expect to","words":[["are",124.95,125.21],["walkers",125.21,125.65],["and",125.65,125.77],["people",125.77,126.05],["with",126.05,126.29],["baby",126.29,126.59],["strollers.",126.59,127.17],["The",127.67,127.83],["purple",127.83,128.11],["group",128.11,128.43],["are",128.43,128.61],["runners",128.61,128.83],["that",128.83,129.01],["expect",129.01,129.33],["to",129.33,129.61]]},{"start":129.61,"end":135.33,"text":"finish in at less than one hour and the yellow group are our elite athletes. We'd like them","words":[["finish",129.61,129.81],["in",129.81,129.99],["at",129.99,130.11],["less",130.11,130.35],["than",130.35,130.55],["one",130.55,130.77],["hour",130.77,131.11],["and",131.11,131.55],["the",131.55,131.67],["yellow",131.67,131.89],["group",131.89,132.27],["are",132.27,132.57],["our",132.57,132.89],["elite",132.89,133.15],["athletes.",133.15,133.55],["We'd",134.39,134.71],["like",134.71,134.99],["them",134.99,135.33]]},{"start":135.33,"end":139.37,"text":"to start the race and we'd like the other groups to follow after that, with the red","words":[["to",135.33,135.53],["start",135.53,135.79],["the",135.79,135.99],["race",135.99,136.25],["and",136.25,136.79],["we'd",136.79,136.97],["like",136.97,137.11],["the",137.11,137.29],["other",137.29,137.43],["groups",137.43,137.69],["to",137.69,137.85],["follow",137.85,138.07],["after",138.07,138.39],["that,",138.39,138.69],["with",138.87,139.05],["the",139.05,139.17],["red",139.17,139.37]]},{"start":139.37,"end":143.27,"text":"group and the strollers at the very back. This is for their own safety.","words":[["group",139.37,139.59],["and",139.59,139.95],["the",139.95,140.13],["strollers",140.13,140.61],["at",140.61,140.85],["the",140.85,140.97],["very",140.97,141.23],["back.",141.23,141.55],["This",141.97,142.21],["is",142.21,142.41],["for",142.41,142.67],["their",142.67,142.83],["own",142.83,142.97],["safety.",142.97,143.27]]},{"start":144.33,"end":149.47,"text":"Now, we are still short on volunteers for the race day, so if you have any friends or family","words":[["Now,",144.33,144.81],["we",145.21,145.53],["are",145.53,145.73],["still",145.73,145.95],["short",145.95,146.25],["on",146.25,146.47],["volunteers",146.47,146.93],["for",146.93,147.21],["the",147.21,147.29],["race",147.29,147.43],["day,",147.43,147.65],["so",147.77,147.91],["if",147.91,148.03],["you",148.03,148.11],["have",148.11,148.29],["any",148.29,148.43],["friends",148.43,148.83],["or",148.83,149.07],["family",149.07,149.47]]},{"start":149.47,"end":154.35,"text":"members who might be interested, please let us know. We're probably OK for people to","words":[["members",149.47,149.91],["who",149.91,150.15],["might",150.15,150.47],["be",150.47,150.69],["interested,",150.69,150.99],["please",151.19,151.39],["let",151.39,151.59],["us",151.59,151.73],["know.",151.73,151.97],["We're",152.65,152.89],["probably",152.89,153.09],["OK",153.09,153.53],["for",153.53,153.87],["people",153.87,154.15],["to",154.15,154.35]]},{"start":154.35,"end":159.39,"text":"help with the start, but we'll still desperately need volunteers along the race course to distribute","words":[["help",154.35,154.51],["with",154.51,154.69],["the",154.69,154.79],["start,",154.79,155.15],["but",155.43,155.55],["we'll",155.55,155.83],["still",155.83,156.19],["desperately",156.19,156.67],["need",156.67,157.01],["volunteers",157.01,157.61],["along",157.61,157.87],["the",157.87,158.07],["race",158.07,158.35],["course",158.35,158.63],["to",158.63,158.89],["distribute",158.89,159.39]]},{"start":159.39,"end":163.83,"text":"water bottles to the runners. A few of you have offered to help with First Aid, but","words":[["water",159.39,159.71],["bottles",159.71,160.03],["to",160.03,160.25],["the",160.25,160.37],["runners.",160.37,160.55],["A",161.59,161.87],["few",161.87,162.07],["of",162.07,162.21],["you",162.21,162.27],["have",162.27,162.43],["offered",162.43,162.65],["to",162.65,162.81],["help",162.81,162.93],["with",162.93,163.13],["First",163.13,163.35],["Aid,",163.35,163.59],["but",163.67,163.83]]},{"start":1